{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2020-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1600214400, "end_date": 1600819199, "month_true_total": 227, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:04 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "76402769", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982418723", "personaname": "XDCR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197982418723/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 6100, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3471, "last_played": 1602274850, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A game that will take weeks to play. but it is interesting as your choices during the game do matter.", "timestamp_created": 1600817349, "timestamp_updated": 1600817349, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76399718", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974912159", "personaname": "brimstone666", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974912159/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 2595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 186, "last_played": 1671414170, "avatar": "3eb5cd64694012ce030861c17c787e4c11d0d32b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes\n", "timestamp_created": 1600811600, "timestamp_updated": 1600811600, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76391603", "author": {"steamid": "76561198362308360", "personaname": "toosa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/t00sa/", "num_games_owned": 53, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 21763, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10284, "last_played": 1718127415, "avatar": "5cd659f5da049a2c7782001dd29a3316f2e53e7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got this game on sale, and I'd recommend anyone giving their own opinion on it despite the negative comments. I like the game's premise: space and exploration. I enjoyed exploring different areas and the awe of discovery in the story. I loved the freedom to play in what way you like but sometimes it felt like there was no clear direction, especially with the outposts and some missions.\n\nThere is a lot of variety in combat styles, and freedom to customize and upgrade your powers. There are many profiles you can choose from to give you the most advantage, depending on the way you like to fight. My favorite was Vanguard. I enjoyed crafting weapons and armor myself. Fighting with these assets is very exhilarating! Guns feel punchy, and launching enemies to the sky with biotics makes you feel invincible.\n\nAnd the characters certainly leave the most impact on you, more so if you choose to romance them. Though, some characters are more memorable than others, but still great. What comes to Ryder's character however, you get to define them yourself. It's quite amazing how lacking the Pathfinder's distinct traits are; they are like a blank slate. How much this affects totally depends on the player, but I found it disappointing. But where Andromeda did deliver was the story and worldbuilding. I've grown attached to the story and the characters enough to want an unlikely sequel.", "timestamp_created": 1600799385, "timestamp_updated": 1621986450, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477941185235977173", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76381656", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003306755", "personaname": "(  .  Y  .  )", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003306755/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3754, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1197, "last_played": 1604201618, "avatar": "ad7f577eee371d20a3aa609213971668f85899a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Environments are huge and sprawling, but the vehicle that you use to cross the environments can be cumbersome. Combat is fluid and enjoyable, with emphasis on the combination powers. Squadmates however, feel useless.", "timestamp_created": 1600786446, "timestamp_updated": 1600786446, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76373851", "author": {"steamid": "76561198295407729", "personaname": "stewart.tyrone99", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198295407729/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6283, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1295, "last_played": 1741874528, "avatar": "11a109aa395bd5c2a89b14921020676fb0d2d95d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I still prefer the original but this is good as a stand alone", "timestamp_created": 1600774394, "timestamp_updated": 1600774394, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "pr